e. protection of women and empowerment of women; f. mental and spiritual; and
g. peace and order.
(2) Prevention of acts of violence by Regional Apparatus as referred to in paragraph (1), shall be implemented in an integrated and continuous manner. Article 23 Efforts to protect women's rights and prevent violations of women's rights carried out by the Regional Government as referred to in Article 22, protection and prevention efforts shall also be carried out by: a. family and/or closest relatives;
b. community leaders and/or customary leaders;
c. educational institutions; and
d. private parties.

