Article 13
(1) Women's empowerment in the economic field as referred to in Article 12 paragraph (3) letter a shall be implemented by Regional Apparatus with authority over economy, manpower, industry and trade, welfare, tourism and culture, cooperatives and SMEs, individuals, community, educational institutions and business sector.
